+<div class="eyebrow">An animated macro-financial scenario · October 2026</div>
+<h1>The Bondfire.</h1>
+<p class="intro">Fiscal promises. Missing buyers. Supply shocks. A self-feeding debt loop. Then the Treasury collateral engine breaks—and Gromen's predicted rescue changes who bears the loss.</p>
+<div class="notice"><strong>Whose story is this?</strong> A dramatization of Luke Gromen's FFTT “Tree Rings,” October 2, 2026. Claims and causal links are attributed to his thesis, not independently verified here. The explosion is a visual metaphor. This is not a forecast or investment advice.</div>
