+<li><a href="https://www.crfb.org/papers/what-would-fiscal-crisis-look">CRFB, “What Would a Fiscal Crisis Look Like?”</a>: multiple crisis paths and gradual fiscal adjustment.</li>
+</ul><p>“Warsh,” “Bessent,” the oil backdrop, MOVE watch zone and the sequencing are the supplied report's scenario context. Neither the 2% real-rate level nor MOVE 120–130 is an established automatic crisis/intervention threshold. The map's Trump political-cover edge is explicitly speculative. Boomers are one cohort, not the sole beneficiaries of federal programs.</p>
